content:
If several Kelkoo Group campaigns run for the same website (multiple MerchantIds), set them all up using **Kelkoo Group Sales tracking - multiple campaign**.

The Multi Merchant Information variable needs this structure:

```
merchantInfo : [
  {
    country:'fr',
    merchantId:'12941513'
  },
  {
    country:'uk',
    merchantId:'56789'
  }
]
```
